    "gama": "gamma",
    "rastie frekvencia a energia fotónu": "frequency and photon energy increase",
    "Spektrum elektromagnetického žiarenia": "Spectrum of electromagnetic radiation",
    "Fotón má vlnovú dĺžku ${@0}\\,\\text{nm}$. Akú energiu má v elektrónvoltoch? Použi $hc \\approx 1240\\,\\text{eV·nm}$.": "A photon has a wavelength of ${@0}\\,\\text{nm}$. What is its energy in electronvolts? Use $hc \\approx 1240\\,\\text{eV·nm}$.",
    "$E=\\frac{hc}{\\lambda}=\\frac{1240}{{@0}}\\,\\text{eV}={@1}\\,\\text{eV}$.": "$E=\\frac{hc}{\\lambda}=\\frac{1240}{{@0}}\\,\\text{eV}={@1}\\,\\text{eV}$.",
    "Energia fotónu je $E=\\frac{hc}{\\lambda}$. Čím kratšia vlnová dĺžka, tým väčšia energia.": "The energy of a photon is $E=\\frac{hc}{\\lambda}$. The shorter the wavelength, the greater the energy.",
    "Pomer si obrátil. Energia je $\\frac{hc}{\\lambda}$, nie $\\frac{\\lambda}{hc}$.": "You inverted the ratio. The energy is $\\frac{hc}{\\lambda}$, not $\\frac{\\lambda}{hc}$.",
    "Svetlo má vlnovú dĺžku ${@0}\\,\\text{nm}$. Aká je jeho frekvencia v jednotkách $10^{14}\\,\\text{Hz}$? Použi $c = 3\\cdot 10^{8}\\,\\text{m/s}$.": "Light has a wavelength of ${@0}\\,\\text{nm}$. What is its frequency in units of $10^{14}\\,\\text{Hz}$? Use $c = 3\\cdot 10^{8}\\,\\text{m/s}$.",
    "$f=\\frac{c}{\\lambda}=\\frac{3\\cdot 10^{8}}{{@0}\\cdot 10^{-9}}\\,\\text{Hz}={@1}\\cdot 10^{14}\\,\\text{Hz}$.": "$f=\\frac{c}{\\lambda}=\\frac{3\\cdot 10^{8}}{{@0}\\cdot 10^{-9}}\\,\\text{Hz}={@1}\\cdot 10^{14}\\,\\text{Hz}$.",
    "Frekvencia je $f=\\frac{c}{\\lambda}$. Nezabudni previesť nm na m.": "The frequency is $f=\\frac{c}{\\lambda}$. Do not forget to convert nm to m.",
    "Frekvencia je $c$ delené vlnovou dĺžkou, nie naopak.": "The frequency is $c$ divided by the wavelength, not the other way round.",
    "jadro": "nucleus",
    "elektróny obiehajú po dráhach": "electrons orbit along paths",
    "Model atómu s jadrom a obežnými dráhami elektrónov": "Model of an atom with a nucleus and electron orbits",
    "Elektrón v atóme vodíka prejde z hladiny $n={@0}$ na hladinu $n={@1}$. Akú energiu vyžiari fotón v $\\text{eV}$? Zaokrúhli na dve desatinné miesta.": "An electron in a hydrogen atom drops from level $n={@0}$ to level $n={@1}$. What energy does the emitted photon have in $\\text{eV}$? Round to two decimal places.",
    "$\\Delta E=13{,}6\\left(\\frac{1}{{@0}^2}-\\frac{1}{{@1}^2}\\right)\\approx {@2}\\,\\text{eV}$.": "$\\Delta E=13{,}6\\left(\\frac{1}{{@0}^2}-\\frac{1}{{@1}^2}\\right)\\approx {@2}\\,\\text{eV}$.",
    "Energia fotónu je rozdiel hladín: $\\Delta E=13{,}6\\left(\\frac{1}{n_f^2}-\\frac{1}{n_i^2}\\right)$ eV.": "The energy of the photon is the difference of the levels: $\\Delta E=13{,}6\\left(\\frac{1}{n_f^2}-\\frac{1}{n_i^2}\\right)$ eV.",
    "V menovateli sú druhé mocniny $n^2$, nie $n$.": "The denominators are the squares $n^2$, not $n$.",
    "Atóm vodíka je v hladine $n={@0}$. Vypočítaj absolútnu hodnotu energie $|E_n|$ v $\\text{eV}$. Výsledok zaokrúhli na dve desatinné miesta.": "A hydrogen atom is on level $n={@0}$. Calculate the absolute value of the energy $|E_n|$ in $\\text{eV}$. Round the result to two decimal places.",
    "$|E_n|=\\frac{13{,}6}{n^2}=\\frac{13{,}6}{{@0}}\\approx {@1}\\,\\text{eV}$.": "$|E_n|=\\frac{13{,}6}{n^2}=\\frac{13{,}6}{{@0}}\\approx {@1}\\,\\text{eV}$.",
    "Energia hladiny je $E_n=-\\frac{13{,}6}{n^2}$ eV.": "The energy of the level is $E_n=-\\frac{13{,}6}{n^2}$ eV.",
